---
// src/pages/index.astro — bare redirect to /en/ (PLAN.md §1). Replaces the
// P1 scaffold-verification harness now that /en/index.astro is real (TODO.md).
//
// `Astro.redirect()` throws `StaticRedirectNotAvailable` under
// `output: "static"` (Astro's own docs: it needs `output: "server"` or
// `"hybrid"`) — verified via context7 rather than assumed. The documented
// static-site pattern is a meta-refresh page instead, which needs no
// JavaScript and works with it disabled.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/en/" />
    <title>TruMandate</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p><a href="/en/">Continue to TruMandate</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
